# Binary image assets are not committed: extracted or derived images of unclear
# provenance are redistributed as original vector drawables instead. See the
# Legal & Trademark Notice in README.md.
#
# docs/screenshots/ is the one exception, and only because of what it contains:
# screenshots of this app's own screens, captured by the maintainer on real
# hardware. They carry no Samsung Health or RingConn artwork, only this
# project's own UI and its own drawables. Anything else stays out.
*.png
*.webp
!docs/screenshots/*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
